# --- Rust Build Artifacts ---
# Contains all compiled binaries, intermediate build files, and docs
/target/

# --- Development & Formatting ---
# Backup files generated by `rustfmt` when fixing code formatting
**/*.rs.bk

# --- Windows MSVC Debugging ---
# Microsoft Visual C++ debugging symbols generated during local compilation
*.pdb

# --- Cargo Dependency Lock ---
# UNCOMMENT the line below ONLY if you are building a library/crate.
# Keep it commented out if you are building an executable application.
# Cargo.lock